   "customData": null,
   "text": "inserting or reordering a track UPDATEs\nposition. A non-DEFERRABLE PK checks\nrow by row → the shifting UPDATE can\nfail with 23505 halfway.\nDeclare the PK DEFERRABLE (checked at\nend of statement); INITIALLY DEFERRED\nif the shift spans several statements.\nDEFERRABLE: cannot be the arbiter for\nON CONFLICT, cannot be an FK target.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "inserting or reordering a track UPDATEs\nposition. A non-DEFERRABLE PK checks\nrow by row → the shifting UPDATE can\nfail with 23505 halfway.\nDeclare the PK DEFERRABLE (checked at\nend of statement); INITIALLY DEFERRED\nif the shift spans several statements.\nDEFERRABLE: cannot be the arbiter for\nON CONFLICT, cannot be an FK target.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.35
  },
